Error [E0121]: `value` was consumed by `consume`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/ownership_call_consume_provenance.jet:8:11
    |
  8 |     print(value)
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: After a value moves to another name, the old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Give away a copy instead (`~value`) where it moved
move site: source bytes 94..99; reuse site: source bytes 111..116; consuming callee: consume
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
